{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"缠结假设"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"缠结假设"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p><strong>缠结假设</strong> (tangle hypothesis) 是说范畴 $\\operatorname{Bord}_1^{\\mathrm{fr}}(\\mathbb{R}^n)$ 是一个对象自由生成的"},{"Local":{"url":"刚性幺半范畴","text":"刚性"}},{"Plain":" "},{"Local":{"url":"En-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_n$"}},{"Plain":"-幺半范畴.</p>\n"}]}}